    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExperience the perfect blend of village charm and modern convenience at 82 Ballisk Court. This beautifully presented 109 sq m home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a bright, spacious, and versatile property within a private, highly sought-after development.\n\nThis home has been maintained to an exacting standard, featuring a seamless flow and quality finishes throughout. The heart of the home is a sweeping kitchen, dining, and living area designed for contemporary life, offering direct access to the mature private gardens. The ground floor is tied together with beautiful solid wooden flooring, providing both durability and a warm, premium aesthetic. The first floor offers three bedrooms, a master bedroom en-suite and a family bathroom. Positioned as an end-of-terrace unit, the property boasts a wide side entrance offering significant potential to extend (subject to planning permission). The rear garden is a true retreat completely private and not overlooked, perfect for al fresco dining or quiet relaxation.\n\n82 Ballisk Court places you exactly where you want to be. Whether you are commuting to the city or escaping to the coast, everything is within reach. Situated in the heart of Donabate, you are just a one-minute stroll from local boutiques, cafes, and social amenities. The Donabate Train Station is a short walk away, providing direct and frequent access to Dublin City Centre. The M1, M50, and Dublin Airport are all easily accessible by car. Enjoy the best of the Irish coastline with the scenic Donabate Beach just a 5-minute drive from your front door. Surrounded by a host of highly-regarded primary and secondary schools. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the scale and finish of this beautiful village home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Prime Location nestled in a private development in the heart of Donabate Village.</li><li> Spacious Layout: Bright & Spacious accommodation measuring approx. 109 sq m.</li><li> Benefits from a wide side entrance with significant potential to extend.</li><li> Bright kitchen/dining/living area with direct garden access.</li><li> Stunning solid wooden flooring throughout the ground floor.</li><li> Secluded rear garden that is not overlooked, offering total privacy.</li><li> Three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master with en-suite.</li><li> Commuter Friendly with minutes' walk to the Train Station; easy access to M1, M50, and Dublin Airport.</li><li> Just a 5-minute drive to the scenic Donabate Beach.</ul>"
      },
